    <detaileddescription>
<para>Saved into every package that holds Tryll node params. Packages saved before it existed read as -1. One entry per change that needs a conversion in TryllMigrations.cpp. Append only: never remove or reorder entries, or saved assets will skip conversions or fail to load. </para>
